WEBVTT

00:00:35.120 --> 00:00:37.080
There's 20 minutes left
to the time of the incident.

00:00:38.870 --> 00:00:39.790
How are you?

00:00:39.790 --> 00:00:41.540
Are you ready?

00:00:41.540 --> 00:00:43.580
Mhmm, no problem.

00:00:43.580 --> 00:00:46.080
After the murderer breaks in,
he'll hide in the bathroom.

00:00:46.080 --> 00:00:48.580
After you turn on the light,
he'll lunge at you with a knife.

00:00:48.580 --> 00:00:51.660
This is the best opportunity
to rip his mask off...

00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:52.660
Lu Guang.

00:00:53.950 --> 00:00:56.580
This time, can you let me take the lead?

00:00:56.580 --> 00:00:57.500
You?

00:00:57.500 --> 00:00:58.580
What do you mean?

00:01:01.040 --> 00:01:03.700
Do you remember
the message the murderer left

00:01:03.700 --> 00:01:05.160
when Qiao Ling last called Xu Shanshan?

00:01:05.160 --> 00:01:06.250
Yes.

00:01:07.040 --> 00:01:11.200
I will show up as promised.

00:01:12.160 --> 00:01:14.700
That's what I thought.

00:01:14.700 --> 00:01:17.040
What if I'm the person

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:18.580
who made an appointment with him?

00:01:18.580 --> 00:01:21.040
Are you saying that
because of us diving back into the photo,

00:01:21.040 --> 00:01:24.200
we have created an alternate timeline?

00:01:24.200 --> 00:01:25.500
That's right.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.790
If you think about it this way...

00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.580
...it all makes sense.

00:01:33.580 --> 00:01:35.040
So what do you plan to do?

00:01:36.120 --> 00:01:38.040
Follow his train of thought,

00:01:38.040 --> 00:01:40.290
give him a few hints,

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:42.790
and bring him into the game.

00:01:42.790 --> 00:01:46.160
I'll regard Emma's message
sent at 10 am as hint.

00:01:52.790 --> 00:01:54.830
Here we are.

00:01:57.370 --> 00:02:00.040
I'm sure perverts like him
who commit such meticulous crimes

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:03.200
can't stand being
seen through and provoked.

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:06.750
After he takes the bait,
we can make our next move--

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:08.330
"Please enter the urn."

00:02:08.330 --> 00:02:11.620
Why do you think he would
he walk right into your trap?

00:02:12.500 --> 00:02:15.290
Because of the motion sensor
doorbell in our shop.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:17.950
Come and receive guests!

00:02:17.950 --> 00:02:21.080
Come and receive guests!

00:02:21.080 --> 00:02:23.450
I've re-recorded a small section
and placed it in the darkroom.

00:02:24.580 --> 00:02:26.450
You're pretty punctual.

00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:29.790
The moment he enters...

00:02:33.750 --> 00:02:35.450
You're pretty punctual.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:41.750
No wonder you were dawdling around
in the darkroom all afternoon,

00:02:41.750 --> 00:02:43.790
you were preparing for this.

00:02:43.790 --> 00:02:45.040
Wow.

00:02:45.040 --> 00:02:48.120
Getting your approval
really isn't an easy thing.

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:49.620
There's another problem.

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:52.370
Even if we can catch
the person who spoke to us,

00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:55.910
how can we prove
that he is the serial killer?

00:02:55.910 --> 00:02:57.700
This is the most exciting
part of the plan,

00:02:57.700 --> 00:02:59.750
but also the most dangerous.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:04:59.160
Are you surprised
that I'm prepared?

00:04:59.160 --> 00:05:02.120
Since I can talk to you through her,

00:05:02.120 --> 00:05:05.790
naturally, I have ways
to perceive your every move.

00:05:05.790 --> 00:05:08.000
Let's play a game.

00:05:08.000 --> 00:05:11.660
You'll receive a clue
at ten in the morning.

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:16.750
My phone...

00:05:18.950 --> 00:05:21.120
Tomorrow at this time,

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:22.870
use the clue to find me.

00:05:27.450 --> 00:05:29.000
Interesting!

00:05:29.000 --> 00:05:33.540
If I win, will you promise
to be my new friend?

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:34.830
I won't inform the police,

00:05:34.830 --> 00:05:37.080
but you must ensure Xu Shanshan's safety.

00:05:43.910 --> 00:05:46.040
I've locked him inside!

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:47.370
Well then,

00:05:47.370 --> 00:05:48.910
the game...

00:05:53.750 --> 00:05:55.160
...is over!

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.450
Oh.

00:05:56.450 --> 00:05:58.290
So it really is you.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:06:00.120
How interesting!

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:05.410
Is killing innocent people
interesting to you, too?

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:07.040
Killing innocent people?

00:06:10.330 --> 00:06:13.370
I'd never do such a worthless thing.

00:06:22.040 --> 00:06:23.830
That doesn't hurt at all.

00:06:26.120 --> 00:06:27.830
Oh, you're gone.

00:06:31.580 --> 00:06:34.790
I've finally found my true friend.

00:06:36.200 --> 00:06:38.790
Even if we can catch the person
who spoke to us,

00:06:38.790 --> 00:06:42.250
how can we prove
that he is the serial killer?

00:06:42.250 --> 00:06:44.080
This is the most exciting
part of the plan,

00:06:44.080 --> 00:06:46.200
but also the most dangerous.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:53.540
What are these?

00:06:53.540 --> 00:06:57.450
I went through various social media
accounts on SNS.

00:06:58.450 --> 00:07:00.000
By sticking these photos
all over the darkroom,

00:07:00.000 --> 00:07:01.830
I can defeat him with ease.

00:07:01.830 --> 00:07:03.700
I'll provoke him.

00:07:05.000 --> 00:07:11.870
A competitive person like him
will inevitably expose his weak points.

00:07:20.950 --> 00:07:22.830
Gosh, what is this?

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:26.250
You only care about yourself,
and you cut off half my face!

00:07:26.250 --> 00:07:28.330
Then, then you do it.

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:33.540
My hand is too short,
my face would look too big.

00:07:33.540 --> 00:07:35.540
It's better if you do it.

00:07:38.370 --> 00:07:41.290
Um, pig head,

00:07:41.290 --> 00:07:43.000
why are you daydreaming?

00:07:54.500 --> 00:07:56.540
Why should I repent?

00:07:56.540 --> 00:07:58.580
What did I do wrong?

00:08:09.450 --> 00:08:11.200
Your parents are in a rush
for you to get married,

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:12.790
but you seem pretty calm.

00:08:13.870 --> 00:08:16.660
Well, is marriage that important?

00:08:16.660 --> 00:08:18.250
Come, Juan Juan, sit properly.

00:08:18.250 --> 00:08:19.950
Let Mommy take a photo of you.

00:08:19.950 --> 00:08:20.950
Oh my goodness,

00:08:20.950 --> 00:08:23.700
I think you might as well spend
the rest of your life with it.

00:08:42.830 --> 00:08:45.620
Committees of each class,
gather after this meeting

00:08:45.620 --> 00:08:48.250
To collect the monthly
exam papers and transcripts.

00:08:48.250 --> 00:08:51.910
We're having such a serious
school meeting, yet here you are,

00:08:51.910 --> 00:08:53.580
secretly taking photos of
your female classmates.

00:08:53.580 --> 00:08:54.540
Are you not ashamed?

00:08:54.540 --> 00:08:58.580
Each photo here represents
a life you've destroyed.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:04.620
And the victims have done nothing wrong!

00:09:09.950 --> 00:09:13.790
The police is investigating
Chenjin's cause of death.

00:09:13.790 --> 00:09:15.950
I see.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:18.750
It's done through clapping.

00:09:21.700 --> 00:09:24.540
Let me see,
were my eyes closed?

00:09:29.790 --> 00:09:32.000
Hmm, this is pretty good.

00:09:32.000 --> 00:09:34.500
I'll go home and edit it a little,
then I'll post it on Weibo.

00:09:36.040 --> 00:09:39.910
Why do young people
love posting stuff online?

00:09:39.910 --> 00:09:41.870
Hey, what do you know?

00:09:41.870 --> 00:09:43.540
This is called sharing.

00:09:43.540 --> 00:09:46.410
Don't you also constantly show off
the designer sweater

00:09:46.410 --> 00:09:48.160
that our daughter bought you?

00:09:48.160 --> 00:09:50.500
How is that the same?

00:09:50.500 --> 00:09:54.410
I'm just showing it off
in our small neighborhood.

00:09:57.330 --> 00:09:59.000
To deprive a person of their life

00:09:59.000 --> 00:10:01.580
is to destroy the happiness
of so many more.

00:10:01.580 --> 00:10:04.160
These innocent victims
are suffering so much

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:06.910
because of you!

00:10:18.790 --> 00:10:21.000
I'm just interested in you.

00:10:22.500 --> 00:10:26.370
Whether those other people live well
or not has nothing to do with me.

00:10:26.370 --> 00:10:28.790
So it really is you!

00:10:28.790 --> 00:10:30.500
You're wrong.

00:10:33.700 --> 00:10:36.200
I'm not the one who wanted to kill them.

00:10:36.200 --> 00:10:38.120
I'm just an agent.

00:10:38.120 --> 00:10:40.660
What do you mean?

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:48.200
I was the one
who killed those people.

00:10:48.200 --> 00:10:50.580
Why would you do that?

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:52.250
Hatred?

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.830
Jealousy?

00:10:53.830 --> 00:10:55.410
Or maybe anger?

00:10:56.250 --> 00:10:57.540
Whatever.

00:10:57.540 --> 00:10:59.790
As long as I had fun.

00:10:59.790 --> 00:11:04.120
Besides, there's no one in this world
that can catch me.

00:11:04.120 --> 00:11:06.700
Why should I care?

00:11:07.660 --> 00:11:08.910
Is that so?

00:11:08.910 --> 00:11:10.870
He admitted to it--arrest him!

00:11:13.330 --> 00:11:14.410
Liu Min!

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:18.250
It's you after all!

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:20.080
Good job.

00:11:20.080 --> 00:11:21.660
You made me admire you even more.

00:11:21.660 --> 00:11:22.700
Stop moving!

00:11:26.830 --> 00:11:29.950
We'll meet again.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:33.830
When that time comes,
make sure you don't cheat again.

00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.790
Stand properly!

00:11:51.790 --> 00:11:53.200
It's too late to pretend to be crippled!

00:11:53.200 --> 00:11:54.500
Get up and walk yourself!

00:12:00.410 --> 00:12:04.160
Even though you guys caught him,
methods like this aren't encouraged.

00:12:04.160 --> 00:12:05.950
In the future, you have to let us know
as soon as possible.

00:12:05.950 --> 00:12:07.830
Oh, I'm sorry.

00:12:07.830 --> 00:12:10.410
We only just realized that
he might come and cause trouble,

00:12:10.410 --> 00:12:12.620
so we took some temporary measures.

00:12:12.620 --> 00:12:15.370
We sent officers to search
Liu Min's other residences,

00:12:15.370 --> 00:12:18.950
and we found Xu Shanshan
in the garage of one of his villas.

00:12:18.950 --> 00:12:21.450
--She's not hurt,
just a little frightened.
--Cheng Xiaoshi, Lu Guang!

00:12:21.450 --> 00:12:23.200
Are you all right?

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.660
Yes, we're fine.

00:12:24.660 --> 00:12:26.160
They've found Shanshan, too.

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:29.540
I'll tell you the details
of the situation later.

00:12:29.540 --> 00:12:33.450
This Lu Guang seems
too mature to be a kid.

00:12:33.450 --> 00:12:37.330
Officer Chen, I hope you can
help me with something.

00:12:37.330 --> 00:12:39.660
I can't take my mind off Emma's case.

00:12:39.660 --> 00:12:42.160
If it's possible, can I...

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:50.200
Liu Min, don't pretend to be dumb.

00:12:51.040 --> 00:12:52.950
We could clearly hear
everything you said just now

00:12:52.950 --> 00:12:54.830
from outside the door.

00:12:55.910 --> 00:12:57.660
Sir,

00:12:57.660 --> 00:12:59.450
I really don't remember anything.

00:12:59.450 --> 00:13:01.370
Who did you ask?

00:13:01.370 --> 00:13:04.080
We found Xu Shanshan in your garage,

00:13:04.080 --> 00:13:06.330
yet you still deny
being the serial killer?

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:09.540
What if I told you

00:13:09.540 --> 00:13:12.160
that my friend was the one
who did all of this,

00:13:12.160 --> 00:13:13.040
would you believe me?

00:13:13.040 --> 00:13:16.410
What? You have an accomplice?

00:13:16.410 --> 00:13:18.500
All right then.

00:13:18.500 --> 00:13:21.580
In chronological order of the crimes,
tell us everything--

00:13:21.580 --> 00:13:22.750
everything you know.

00:13:28.160 --> 00:13:31.450
I remember this bitch clearly.

00:13:35.950 --> 00:13:37.830
That's more or less what happened.

00:13:37.830 --> 00:13:39.620
Cheng Xiaoshi planned the arrest.

00:13:40.700 --> 00:13:42.910
Oh wow, Cheng Xiaoshi,

00:13:42.910 --> 00:13:45.750
I never knew you could be
reliable as well.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:46.660
Huh?

00:13:46.660 --> 00:13:48.830
It's no big deal.

00:13:48.830 --> 00:13:50.120
Are you okay?

00:13:50.120 --> 00:13:51.790
Your mind is somewhere else.

00:13:53.540 --> 00:13:56.540
Something's still troubling me
and I can't find the answer.

00:13:56.540 --> 00:14:00.410
It's Liu Min's alibi
in Emma's case.

00:14:00.410 --> 00:14:01.700
If that's the case,

00:14:01.700 --> 00:14:05.540
is Emma's murderer someone else?

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:11.120
This is a surveillance photo
of Wu Lihua before her death,

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.200
remember not to share it with anyone else.

00:14:15.080 --> 00:14:17.580
I requested Emma's surveillance
photos from Officer Chen.

00:14:17.580 --> 00:14:18.450
Lu Guang, take a look.

00:14:18.450 --> 00:14:20.000
See if you can find any clues.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:30.700
This Emma person worked in
our company's finance department.

00:14:30.700 --> 00:14:31.950
She was new, yet it wasn't long before

00:14:31.950 --> 00:14:34.660
she was promoted to become
the CFO's assistant.

00:14:35.660 --> 00:14:37.870
Mr. Liu, what are you doing?

00:14:37.870 --> 00:14:39.700
Open the door! I want to get off!

00:14:40.620 --> 00:14:42.450
Get off?

00:14:42.450 --> 00:14:45.370
Are you trying to run away with the money?

00:14:45.370 --> 00:14:48.580
I suspected that she took my money
while Old Man Zhu was being arrested.

00:14:48.580 --> 00:14:51.500
I just wanted to scare her a little,

00:14:51.500 --> 00:14:54.080
but unfortunately...

00:14:54.080 --> 00:14:57.290
You people at the bottom of the society,
why do you always give me trouble?

00:14:57.290 --> 00:14:59.660
You live like dogs,

00:14:59.660 --> 00:15:01.330
yet online, you slander me,

00:15:01.330 --> 00:15:02.700
criticize me!

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:05.040
And after all that,
you still covet my money!

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:07.080
Die, die!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.330
All of you must die!

00:15:12.080 --> 00:15:13.950
At the time, I was terrified.

00:15:13.950 --> 00:15:15.370
I thought I had accidentally
killed someone,

00:15:15.370 --> 00:15:17.040
and there was even a witness.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:26.160
But there was no one in the trunk.

00:15:27.120 --> 00:15:30.080
I thought I had bumped into a ghost.

00:15:30.080 --> 00:15:34.290
Why does it sound like
you're trying to fool me?

00:15:34.290 --> 00:15:36.700
So how did Wu Lihua die in the end?

00:15:36.700 --> 00:15:38.120
I got back in the car in a hurry,

00:15:38.120 --> 00:15:42.250
I wanted to send the woman
to the hospital, but...

00:15:50.120 --> 00:15:51.950
Ghost!

00:15:55.200 --> 00:15:57.450
There's only one camera
on the abandoned bridge,

00:15:57.450 --> 00:15:59.870
and the field of vision is too small.

00:15:59.870 --> 00:16:01.370
All I can see...

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:04.790
...is a pretty injured Emma.

00:16:04.790 --> 00:16:06.830
I thought she had turned into a zombie,

00:16:06.830 --> 00:16:09.120
I was too afraid to even
grip the steering wheel.

00:16:09.120 --> 00:16:10.750
That bitch even lunged at me.

00:16:12.000 --> 00:16:13.450
Let me get off!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.620
--Go away!
--Let me get off!

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:27.750
That's how I crashed the car,
and then I passed out.

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:31.120
This leg is also thanks to her.

00:16:31.120 --> 00:16:34.450
Lu Guang, let me dive into
the photo and check it out.

00:16:34.450 --> 00:16:37.120
The truth may not give you
a satisfactory answer.

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:40.040
Let me witness it personally this time.

00:16:40.040 --> 00:16:42.830
But Emma's fate
changed because of me.

00:16:42.830 --> 00:16:46.330
That's why I'll try again
no matter what happens.

00:17:16.620 --> 00:17:21.500
You bitch, I'll make you pay.

00:17:21.500 --> 00:17:24.750
I'll kill your whole family!

00:18:05.290 --> 00:18:08.040
What's so great about this shoe?

00:18:08.040 --> 00:18:09.450
What do you know?

00:18:09.450 --> 00:18:11.330
This is fashion.

00:18:11.330 --> 00:18:15.000
So fashion is basically a comparison
of whose is more expensive.

00:18:17.830 --> 00:18:20.000
When I grow up and work in the city,

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.580
I'll dress you guys up

00:18:21.580 --> 00:18:24.160
in the most fashionable
clothing from head to toe.

00:18:28.290 --> 00:18:32.870
Our Lihua is currently working as an
executive at that Haode Games company!

00:18:32.870 --> 00:18:35.000
Dad, it's Quede Games.

00:18:35.000 --> 00:18:35.870
Oh, it's the same.

00:18:35.870 --> 00:18:39.330
Besides, it's just the CFO's assistant.

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:40.580
Listen to that.

00:18:40.580 --> 00:18:42.330
It's "Chief,"

00:18:42.330 --> 00:18:44.700
and in charge of finance!

00:18:44.700 --> 00:18:45.830
When she was young,

00:18:45.830 --> 00:18:47.080
she always said

00:18:47.080 --> 00:18:49.250
she would go to the city
and make money for us to spend.

00:18:49.250 --> 00:18:53.120
Haha, look at her now,
she's doing pretty well.

00:19:05.040 --> 00:19:08.330
My dear daughter,
you're doing well.

00:19:12.160 --> 00:19:13.410
Emma,

00:19:13.410 --> 00:19:14.580
this toast is to you.

00:19:14.580 --> 00:19:15.950
Uh, Mr. Zhu,

00:19:15.950 --> 00:19:17.910
I don't know how to drink.

00:19:19.370 --> 00:19:21.250
Is drinking something you need to learn?

00:19:21.250 --> 00:19:22.830
Exactly. Who needs to learn to drink?

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:24.500
Just drink it then you'll know how to.

00:19:24.500 --> 00:19:27.290
Mr. Zhu's hand is getting tired.

00:19:27.290 --> 00:19:28.250
Drink!

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:29.200
Drink!

00:19:29.200 --> 00:19:30.250
Drink!

00:19:30.250 --> 00:19:31.250
Drink!

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:32.200
Drink!

00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:33.200
Drink!

00:19:33.200 --> 00:19:34.040
Drink!

00:19:34.040 --> 00:19:35.330
You got promoted.

00:19:35.330 --> 00:19:38.450
Shouldn't you at least
have a toast as gratitude?

00:19:42.250 --> 00:19:43.660
Thank you, Mr. Zhu.

00:19:43.660 --> 00:19:44.500
Wow!

00:19:44.500 --> 00:19:46.080
Great!

00:19:47.620 --> 00:19:50.450
People who can drink
can really drink, right?

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:54.290
One more drink!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.540
One more drink!

00:19:56.540 --> 00:20:00.120
My dear daughter,
how are you lately?

00:20:03.790 --> 00:20:06.620
That's enough now,
she's busy,

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:08.750
don't keep disturbing her all the time.

00:20:12.040 --> 00:20:14.040
I'm afraid of disturbing her,

00:20:14.040 --> 00:20:16.540
that's why I've been
texting her so little.

00:20:52.660 --> 00:20:53.660
Emma!

00:21:06.000 --> 00:21:07.200
Who are you?

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:11.500
I'm sorry.

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:16.540
Your misfortune tonight
is all because of me.

00:21:17.540 --> 00:21:21.250
Someone once warned me
that I cannot change the past,

00:21:21.250 --> 00:21:22.660
but I didn't listen.

00:21:23.620 --> 00:21:26.080
I thought replying to your
mother's text on behalf of you

00:21:26.080 --> 00:21:27.870
would make all of you happier.

00:21:32.620 --> 00:21:35.250
You sent that message on behalf of me?

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:38.120
How is that possible?

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:41.160
Who exactly are you?

00:21:41.160 --> 00:21:43.040
My name is Cheng Xiaoshi.

00:21:43.040 --> 00:21:46.370
I have the ability to dive back
into the past through photos.

00:21:46.370 --> 00:21:50.120
I've returned to this moment
to make up for my mistakes.

00:21:52.580 --> 00:21:55.500
If that's true,

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:58.540
can you help me return to the beginning...

00:22:02.450 --> 00:22:05.870
...and start all over?

00:22:05.870 --> 00:22:07.200
Mr. Zhu,

00:22:07.200 --> 00:22:10.040
why are there two sets of accounts?

00:22:10.040 --> 00:22:11.120
And also,

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:12.750
in the other set of accounts,

00:22:12.750 --> 00:22:15.910
the depreciation of fixed assets
is ridiculously high.

00:22:16.830 --> 00:22:18.040
Emma,

00:22:18.040 --> 00:22:20.870
you learn very quickly,
and you're very detailed.

00:22:20.870 --> 00:22:24.410
But you don't have enough
experience in the real world.

00:22:24.410 --> 00:22:28.580
Some accounts can't be calculated
clearly just by studying.

00:22:28.580 --> 00:22:31.410
But this is obviously
creating false accounts.

00:22:31.410 --> 00:22:33.500
If we were to be discovered, we would...

00:22:33.500 --> 00:22:35.080
Go to jail?

00:22:35.080 --> 00:22:38.870
Does a son need to go to jail
for stealing his father's money?

00:22:38.870 --> 00:22:42.290
Liu Min has been financially cut off
by his father a long time ago.

00:22:42.290 --> 00:22:46.290
He wanted me to get him
some pocket money from his father.

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:49.120
I can do someone a favor,

00:22:49.120 --> 00:22:50.870
and collect some levy as well,

00:22:50.870 --> 00:22:53.040
why not?

00:22:53.040 --> 00:22:56.370
And besides,
this is their family matter,

00:22:56.370 --> 00:22:58.660
the law can't do anything about it.

00:22:58.660 --> 00:23:01.620
You've been working so hard recently.

00:23:01.620 --> 00:23:03.950
This is an advance bonus for you.

00:23:04.910 --> 00:23:07.080
You should save up some money,

00:23:07.080 --> 00:23:09.000
buy a house in the city,

00:23:09.000 --> 00:23:11.330
and bring your family here soon.

00:23:13.370 --> 00:23:15.750
I want to go back in time,

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:18.330
return that dirty money,

00:23:18.330 --> 00:23:21.540
and reject Zhu's harassment.

00:23:21.540 --> 00:23:24.540
I want to start a new life!

00:23:45.200 --> 00:23:48.040
I've experienced many different lives,

00:23:48.040 --> 00:23:51.620
but there's always something
I regret in almost every life.

00:23:51.620 --> 00:23:53.660
To expand influence,

00:23:53.660 --> 00:23:56.450
to allow my brand name
to be used everywhere,

00:23:56.450 --> 00:23:59.700
the noodle business
no longer belongs to me.

00:24:02.540 --> 00:24:04.790
I can't let it go.

00:24:04.790 --> 00:24:06.700
I really can't.

00:24:07.750 --> 00:24:09.290
Ok, pinky promise!

00:24:11.580 --> 00:24:13.080
It's daddy's fault...

00:24:13.080 --> 00:24:14.870
It's daddy's fault...

00:24:14.870 --> 00:24:17.120
Come back to me...

00:24:17.120 --> 00:24:19.160
And every time,

00:24:19.160 --> 00:24:20.870
no matter how hard I try...

00:24:21.830 --> 00:24:23.870
...there's no guarantee
I can get a perfect ending.

00:24:34.910 --> 00:24:38.160
Maybe I can't give you a perfect past,

00:24:38.160 --> 00:24:41.700
but I can't let you miss out
on a better future.

00:24:41.700 --> 00:24:43.540
Future?

00:24:43.540 --> 00:24:45.660
What future do I have left?

00:24:45.660 --> 00:24:47.870
This is what I've learned

00:24:47.870 --> 00:24:50.040
from all the people that are
trying their best to live.

00:24:51.080 --> 00:24:55.620
Some people persevere
their whole life for love.

00:24:55.620 --> 00:24:59.290
Ou Yang, I've come to marry you!

00:25:00.500 --> 00:25:01.750
Lin Zhen.

00:25:01.750 --> 00:25:06.700
Some people get lost
before finding themselves again.

00:25:06.700 --> 00:25:08.160
Welcome back.

00:25:09.790 --> 00:25:15.000
As long as mom is here,
you'll be just fine.

00:25:15.000 --> 00:25:19.500
Some people have taught me
what it is to be a parent.

00:25:19.500 --> 00:25:22.330
As long as you keep looking...
and keep looking...

00:25:22.330 --> 00:25:26.040
...for ten years,
20 years, or even more...

00:25:26.040 --> 00:25:29.200
You'll final get the answer
you've longed for.

00:25:31.290 --> 00:25:32.620
And some people...

00:25:44.660 --> 00:25:46.580
...have finally gotten their answer.

00:25:49.870 --> 00:25:51.580
I believe

00:25:51.580 --> 00:25:54.370
everyone has a reason
to try their best to live.

00:25:59.040 --> 00:26:02.620
Even though there are times
when we find ourselves in the darkness...

00:26:18.000 --> 00:26:22.500
...eventually, we will meet people
who will shine their light on us.

00:26:40.750 --> 00:26:42.120
Captain Xiao, how is it?

00:26:42.120 --> 00:26:43.540
Has he told you everything?

00:26:43.540 --> 00:26:46.250
He kept going on and on
about how his friend was the culprit,

00:26:46.250 --> 00:26:47.750
and none of this has anything
to do with him.

00:26:49.200 --> 00:26:50.830
Does he have schizophrenia?

00:26:50.830 --> 00:26:52.290
Or Multiple Personality Disorder?

00:26:52.290 --> 00:26:54.910
Maybe he mistook one of his
other personalities to be his friend?

00:26:56.250 --> 00:26:57.700
Impossible.

00:26:57.700 --> 00:27:00.950
The doctor has issued a statement
proving that he's mentally sound.

00:27:02.660 --> 00:27:04.580
Hey, speaking of doctor's statement,

00:27:04.580 --> 00:27:07.040
shouldn't he be paralyzed?

00:27:07.040 --> 00:27:10.040
Then, how did he run into
the photo studio?

00:27:10.040 --> 00:27:12.250
My friend,

00:27:12.250 --> 00:27:14.790
come quickly!

00:27:14.790 --> 00:27:20.950
Come and help me kill
all these annoying insects!

00:27:31.580 --> 00:27:33.250
How is this possible?

00:27:33.250 --> 00:27:35.500
Death is a major node
that cannot be changed.

00:27:35.500 --> 00:27:36.750
Hmm?

00:27:36.750 --> 00:27:38.790
Are you talking to Cheng Xiaoshi?

00:27:42.410 --> 00:27:45.660
Didn't you say that
nothing in this world is absolute?

00:27:56.660 --> 00:28:00.700
I didn't realize
there was a witness.

00:28:00.700 --> 00:28:02.040
Interesting.

00:28:02.040 --> 00:28:03.830
This voice...

00:28:03.830 --> 00:28:04.910
Unless,

00:28:04.910 --> 00:28:06.410
Liu Min is just a puppet,

00:28:06.410 --> 00:28:08.330
and the real culprit is someone else!

00:28:08.330 --> 00:28:09.830
We have to shoot the photos well,

00:28:09.830 --> 00:28:12.700
and let everybody in school notice us.

00:28:12.700 --> 00:28:14.000
No problem, Captain.

00:28:14.000 --> 00:28:15.330
I'm a professional.

00:28:21.330 --> 00:28:23.830
Why are my glasses making things worse?

00:28:29.830 --> 00:28:33.450
My son had an accident not long ago,
and was paralyzed.

00:28:33.450 --> 00:28:35.910
He couldn't have committed the crime!

00:28:46.620 --> 00:28:47.910
Could it be...

00:28:49.700 --> 00:28:52.450
Are you his friend?

00:28:52.450 --> 00:28:53.950
You're someone...

00:28:53.950 --> 00:28:55.910
...with the ability to possess spirits.

00:28:55.910 --> 00:28:56.950
Emma!

00:29:28.790 --> 00:29:30.040
Qiao Ling!

00:29:34.040 --> 00:29:37.120
This is your punishment for
breaking the rules of the game.

00:29:39.000 --> 00:29:40.450
Who the heck are you?

00:29:43.620 --> 00:29:46.790
Now, the game has been reset.
